        <member name="T:Gordic.Ebp.Service.GRestPublisherService">
            <summary>
            Provides functionality to manage and publish messages to a pool of REST publishers.
            </summary>
            <remarks>This service is responsible for coordinating the retrieval of messages from an event reader and
            distributing them to a pool of REST publishers. It ensures that publishers process messages in the correct order,
            handles backpressure when publishers cannot accept new messages, and manages missed messages for publishers that
            fall behind.  The service operates in a loop, periodically fetching messages from the event reader and distributing
            them to publishers. Publishers that are unable to process messages due to capacity constraints are temporarily
            skipped, and their missed messages are tracked for later processing.</remarks>
        </member>
