        <member name="T:Gordic.Ebp.Service.GExtSystemRestPublisher">
            <summary>
            Represents a REST-based publisher for external systems, responsible for processing and sending messages to
            configured endpoints based on subscription settings.
            </summary>
            <remarks>This class extends GQueuedMessageRestPublisher and implements <see
            cref="T:Gordic.Ebp.Interface.IGRestPublisher"/>. It processes messages by validating them against subscription configurations and sending
            them to the appropriate endpoints. If a message fails to be sent, it handles retries and logs the failure.</remarks>
        </member>
